:"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[58,63,70,64,65,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21003","armor":"WP1000805","helmet":"WP1021405","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[58,63,70,64,65,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21003","armor":"WP1000805","helmet":"WP1021405","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[58,63,70,64,65,59],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21003","armor":"WP1000805","helmet":"WP1021405","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[58,63,70,64,65,59],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"110","reputation":"4400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21003","armor":"WP1000805","helmet":"WP1021405","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10060","city":"CS1009","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[58,63,70,64,65,59],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"110","reputation":"4400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP21003","armor":"WP1000805","helmet":"WP1021405","horse":"WP29009"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"袁绍麾下将领，出身清河崔氏旁支，精通占星术。早年追随袁绍讨董、争霸北方，袁绍在界桥之战后派遣崔巨业率数万兵马北上，围攻公孙瓒据守的军事重镇故安。然而他久攻不克，在撤军南归途中，于巨马水被公孙瓒亲率的三万步骑追上，遭到大败，阵亡七八千人。","tc":"袁紹麾下將領，出身清河崔氏旁支，精通占星術。早年追隨袁紹討董、爭霸北方，袁紹在界橋之戰后派遣崔巨業率數萬兵馬北上，圍攻公孫瓚據守的軍事重鎮故安。然而他久攻不克，在撤軍南歸途中，于巨馬水被公孫瓚親率的三萬步騎追上，遭到大敗，陣亡七八千人。","en":"A general under Yuan Shao, hailing from a collateral branch of the Cui clan of Qinghe and skilled in astrology. He followed Yuan Shao in the campaign against Dong Zhuo and the struggle for supremacy in the north. After the Battle of Jieqiao, Yuan Shao dispatched Cui Juye with tens of thousands of troops northward to besiege the strategic fortress of Gu'an held by Gongsun Zan. However, Cui Juye was unable to take the stronghold, and during his withdrawal southward, he was overtaken at the Juma River by Gongsun Zan leading thirty thousand infantry and cavalry. He suffered a devastating defeat, losing seven to eight thousand men.","jp":"袁紹配下の将。清河崔氏の傍流の出身で、占星術に通じていた。早くから袁紹に従って董卓討伐や北方の覇権争いに加わった。界橋の戦いの後、袁紹の命を受け数万の兵馬を率いて北上し、公孫瓚の拠る軍事の要衝・故安を包囲した。しかし攻略することは叶わず、撤退して南へ帰還する途上、巨馬水にて公孫瓚自ら率いる歩騎三万に追いつかれて大敗を喫し、七、八千人の戦死者を出した。","kr":"원소 휘하의 장수로, 청하 최씨 방계 출신이며 점성술에 정통했다. 일찍이 원소를 따라 동탁 토벌과 북방 쟁패에 종군했다. 계교 전투 이후 원소의 명을 받아 수만 병마를 이끌고 북상해 공손찬이 지키던 군사 요충지 고안을 포위 공격했다. 그러나 오랜 공격에도 함락시키지 못했고, 철군하여 남쪽으로 돌아가던 중 거마수에서 공손찬이 친히 이끄는 보병과 기병 3만 명에게 추격을 당해 대패하였으며, 7~8천 명이 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1025515","remark":"","surname":"崔","surnameTc":"崔","surnameEn":"Cui","surnameJp":"崔","surnameKr":"최","surnameOther":"","name":"巨业","nameTc":"巨業","nameEn":"Juye","nameJp":"巨業","nameKr":"거업","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"崔巨业","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"185","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"58","force":"63","wise":"70","politics":"64","charm":"65","will":"59","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","wea